-- The Brittle Star (ours): the crew's spacecraft, made by Death in Space's hub steps (pp. 26-33) and drawn in our pieces.
-- An old chrome ship: crew quarters with four bunks to the north-west, the command center to the north-east with its
-- consoles and the comms that won't stop talking, a corridor from airlock 13C on the west, the mess and life support's
-- tanks to the south-west, and the engine room to the south-east, with the cold engine, cargo and the empty fuel tank.

